<metadata><name>Galičica trail H-1</name><desc>H-1 is one of Galičica National Park's easier and shorter hiking trails. It's 1.7 km from near Velestovo to near Racha, with about 15 m of climbing and 134 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 880 m and 1,001 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/h-1/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
